          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, upper margin:",
          "value": "<p>Margin top: So I thought about what I had endured in the [des]ert [and how I was saved;] then it appeared to me an easy matter to embark on a sea voyage. I took Man\u1e63\u016br as my travel companion, but not Ma\u02bf\u0101n\u012b,</p>",
